GetPriceUSD_Integration_Concrete_Test
├── given asset unconfigured
│  └── it should revert with UnknownAsset
└── given asset configured
   ├── when feed answer non positive
   │  └── it should revert with InvalidPrice
   ├── when feed updated within heartbeat
   │  └── it should return the 1e18-scaled price
   ├── when feed staler than heartbeat
   │  └── it should revert with StalePrice
   └── when feed updated in future
      └── it should revert with StalePrice
